WEBVTT

00:15:59.161 --> 00:16:01.817
i to tim koji sada radi u dva sela

00:16:01.817 --> 00:16:04.314
gde obučavaju naredna dva sela

00:16:04.314 --> 00:16:06.168
kako bi širili posao.

00:16:06.168 --> 00:16:08.107
A ovo je, po mom mišljenju, ključno.

00:16:08.107 --> 00:16:12.508
(Aplauz)

00:16:12.508 --> 00:16:16.284
Ljudi nisu problem.

00:16:16.284 --> 00:16:17.900
Nikada to nismo iskusili.

00:16:17.900 --> 00:16:19.978
Problem je loše životno okruženje,

00:16:19.978 --> 00:16:24.956
loše kuće i paraziti koji štete ljudima.

00:16:24.956 --> 00:16:27.991
Ništa od ovog nije geografski ograničeno,

00:16:27.991 --> 00:16:32.922
ili određeno bojom kože
ili religijom. Ništa.